The points $A$ and $B$ are on the legs of the isosceles right triangle $A_1A_2B_2B_1$ such that $\triangle ABP$ is also right triangle. If $AP=3$, $BP=4$ and $A_1P=6$, find the length of $A_1B_1$. [asy]
pair P, A1, B1, A2, B2, A, B;
A1=(0,0);
B1=(0,10);
A2=(10,0);
B2=(10,10);
A=(5,0);
B=(0,6);
P=(4,3);
